  (text "Power: the dev board's own USB connector. Do not inject another supply into the 3V3 pin." (at 8.89 6.35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid d218b89a-2440-4b18-a537-d928ceaba9de)
  )
  (text "5V pin = VBUS = +5V_SPS = SPS30 VDD, always on. 3V3 pin = onboard LDO = +3V3 for U2 U3 U4 U5 and R1 R2." (at 8.89 8.89 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 322899c6-0994-43a3-ad78-4b91f432f83d)
  )
  (text "LOLIN32 silkscreen 5V and 3V3. ESP32 D1 mini silkscreen 5V (some print 5V0) and 3V3." (at 8.89 11.43 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 22525b8a-9a42-4d47-aa2d-007ffb50e2eb)
  )
  (text "SDA GPIO21, SCL GPIO22. Leave the LOLIN32 PH-2 battery socket empty." (at 8.89 13.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 7877ef73-c63a-4e3a-80ac-0d1be82bc3a8)
  )
  (text "I2C is 100 kHz at 3.3 V. R1 and R2 are 4.7k to +3V3. Never pull SDA or SCL up to 5 V." (at 8.89 16.51 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 937ad7e9-b8ab-4d1f-add4-3109b26fef8d)
  )
  (text "Fit U4 SCD30 (0x61, SEL to GND) or U5 SCD41 (0x62), not both. U6 SEL to GND selects I2C 0x69 before power-up." (at 8.89 19.05 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 1928c354-7778-4545-b1c3-984c0e3baef1)
  )
  (text "Leave open: GPIO0/2/12/15 (strap), GPIO5 (LED, active low), GPIO1/TX, GPIO3/RX, GPIO4, GPIO26, GPIO36/VP, GPIO6-11 (flash)." (at 8.89 21.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 7ad9c6da-d9d6-4af0-a34b-789021e43f9f)
  )

